<title>GERMANY: Merrill raises Mannesmann rating to buy.</title>
<headline>Merrill raises Mannesmann rating to buy.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. brokerage house Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it raised its rating on German industrial group Mannesmann AG to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>A Merrill official confirmed the rating change but the analyst who made the recommendation was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
